```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant App as Application Init
    participant Entry as PatientEntryScreen
    participant List as MedicationListScreen
    participant DetailA as MedDetail (Cond A)
    participant DetailB as PlainText (Cond B)
    participant Comp as ComprehensionScreen
    participant Logger as StudyLogger

    Note over App,Logger: Phase 1: Initialization (<1 second)
    App->>App: Check MODE=patient flag
    App->>App: Load prescriptions (~50KB), i18n (~550KB), SVGs (~200KB)
    
    Note over Entry,Logger: Phase 2: Patient Entry
    App->>Entry: Navigate to /patient
    Entry->>Entry: Input code & select condition
    Entry->>Logger: startSession(code, condition) [Time: <1ms]
    Entry->>List: Navigate
    
    Note over List,Logger: Phase 3: Medication List (Loop 5x)
    List->>List: Display Progress (e.g. 1 of 5)
    List->>DetailA: Tap Drug (if Cond A)
    List->>DetailB: Tap Drug (if Cond B)
    
    Note over DetailA,Logger: Phase 4A: Condition A (Rich Detail)
    DetailA->>DetailA: Load Language Map [Time: <1ms]
    par Animation
        DetailA->>DetailA: Load SVG & AnatomyViewer loop [60fps target]
        DetailA->>DetailA: MechanismAnimator periodic reveal [1.8s steps]
    and Audio
        DetailA->>DetailA: TTS lazy init (first time: ~200-500ms)
        DetailA->>DetailA: TTS playback (15-30s)
        DetailA->>Logger: Record audioPlayed = true
    end
    DetailA->>Comp: Tap "Answer Questions"
    
    Note over DetailB,Logger: Phase 4B: Condition B (Control)
    DetailB->>DetailB: Display Static Table [Render: <5ms]
    DetailB->>Logger: Record audioPlayed = false
    DetailB->>Comp: Tap "Answer Questions"
    
    Note over Comp,Logger: Phase 5: Comprehension Quiz (6 Qs)
    Comp->>Comp: Display Question 1
    Comp->>Comp: User selects answer (Compute correct)
    Comp->>Logger: logAnswer() [Time: <1ms, In-memory list]
    Note right of Logger: Log entry added
    Comp->>Comp: Next Question (Loop to Q6)
    Comp->>List: Return to List (Next drug or finish)
    
    Note over Entry,Logger: Phase 6: Export (After 5 drugs)
    Entry->>Logger: Action: exportToCsv()
    Logger->>Logger: Collect 30 rows from memory
    Logger->>Logger: Format & Write to CSV [Time: <100ms]
    Logger-->>Entry: Show SnackBar with file path
```
